# ACP support

OpenCode can run as an Agent Client Protocol server via:

```bash
opencode acp
```

Editors configure OpenCode as an external agent command. Example shape:

```json
{
  "agent_servers": {
    "OpenCode": {
      "command": "opencode",
      "args": ["acp"]
    }
  }
}
```

ACP uses the same OpenCode features: configured tools, custom commands, MCP servers, rules, agents, and permissions.

