# Custom tools

Custom tools can be TypeScript or JavaScript files in `.opencode/tools/` or `~/.config/opencode/tools/`.

```ts
import { tool } from "@opencode-ai/plugin"

export default tool({
  description: "Query project metadata",
  args: {
    query: tool.schema.string(),
  },
  async execute(args, context) {
    return `Query: ${args.query}; directory: ${context.directory}`
  },
})
```

The filename becomes the tool name. Multiple named exports become `<filename>_<exportname>`. Prefer unique names to avoid replacing built-in tools accidentally.

