# Formatters and LSP

Disable all formatters:

```json
{
  "formatter": false
}
```

Disable or override one formatter:

```json
{
  "formatter": {
    "prettier": {
      "disabled": true
    }
  }
}
```

Disable all LSP servers:

```json
{
  "lsp": false
}
```

Custom LSP:

```json
{
  "lsp": {
    "custom-lsp": {
      "command": ["custom-lsp-server", "--stdio"],
      "extensions": [".custom"]
    }
  }
}
```

