# OpenCode models

Model IDs use `provider/model-id`. Examples: `opencode/gpt-5.2-codex`, `anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-5`, `openai/gpt-5`.

Use `configuru_models_get` to list provider/model IDs available in the current OpenCode runtime before writing model IDs.

OpenCode default model:

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "model": "provider/model-id"
}
```

Agent model override:

```json
{
  "agent": {
    "review": {
      "model": "provider/model-id"
    }
  }
}
```

Provider model options live under `provider.<provider>.models.<model>.options`. Variants can be configured under `variants` for providers that support them.
